      "writtenOn": "2019-05-23T02:53:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So one reason to put these extern here is we do not want to expose these variables. Ideally these should be kept static in fpsensor_state.c and not accessible elsewhere, but fpsensor.c needs to access them, and it\u0027s the only exception. That\u0027s why initially I made fpsensor.h reference these variables like using \"extern\". Any ideas?",
      "parentUuid": "ddcca057_b8e7ea3b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 0,
